! ADGUARD COMPATIBILITY
! ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
! https://github.com/AdguardTeam/FiltersCompiler/issues/164
! https://github.com/AdguardTeam/tsurlfilter/issues/148
0.0.realodix##.btn[onclick]:remove-attr(onclick)
0.0.realodix##body:remove-class(cdk-global-scrollblock)
! https://github.com/AdguardTeam/FiltersCompiler/issues/206
||ex-ample.org^$script,from=ex-ample.com
! https://github.com/AdguardTeam/ExtendedCss/issues/138
0.0.realodix##div.banner:matches-css-before(content: /adv/i)
! https://github.com/AdguardTeam/ExtendedCss/issues/164
0.0.realodix##:matches-path(/^/home/) [data-testid="primaryColumn"]:others()
!
0.0.realodix##+js(prevent-window-open)
